{"created":1787301241,"minutes":43200,"value":[{"id":"18115561124302412","caption":"B\u00fdval\u00fd pivovar v Hole\u0161ovic\u00edch. \u010cern\u00fd strop pln\u00fd technologi\u00ed. A pod n\u00edm pastelov\u00fd interi\u00e9r nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00ed spole\u010dnosti KAPITOL.\n\nSpole\u010dn\u011b s klientem jsme pro\u0161li n\u011bkolik pra\u017esk\u00fdch adres a pro ka\u017edou p\u0159ipravili testovac\u00ed spaceplan. Nakonec rozhodla atmosf\u00e9ra Hole\u0161ovick\u00e9ho pivovaru, jeho historie a v\u00fdrazn\u00fd industri\u00e1ln\u00ed charakter.\n\nP\u0159iznan\u00e9 rozvody, kov a \u010dern\u00fd strop jsme doplnili pastelovou modrou a zelenou, d\u0159evem, obl\u00fdmi tvary n\u00e1bytku a sv\u011btlem, kter\u00e9 zv\u00fdraz\u0148uje jednotliv\u00e9 detaily.\n\nNa m\u00edru vznikl kovov\u00fd obklad s logem, d\u00fdhovan\u00e9 obklady i atypick\u00fd n\u00e1bytek.\n\nDispozice vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 ka\u017ed\u00fd metr prostoru. Na vstup navazuje lounge, vedle n\u011bj dv\u011b \u0159editelsk\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e. Phoneboxy a copy centrum jsou um\u00edst\u011bn\u00e9 ve st\u0159edu kancel\u00e1\u0159e. Zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnost se otev\u00edr\u00e1 sm\u011brem k lounge, d\u00edky \u010demu\u017e ob\u011b \u010d\u00e1sti p\u016fsob\u00ed vzdu\u0161n\u011bji a velkoryseji.\n\nD\u016fle\u017eitou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed n\u00e1vrhu byla tak\u00e9 akustika. Charakter p\u0159iznan\u00e9ho stropu jsme zachovali a hluk v prostoru \u0159e\u0161ili pomoc\u00ed plst\u011bn\u00fdch lamel, koberc\u016f, z\u00e1v\u011bs\u016f a \u010daloun\u011bn\u00e9ho n\u00e1bytku.\n\nZa realizac\u00ed stoj\u00ed t\u00fdm U1 space design.\n\nMichal Gr\u00f3f vedl projekt a koordinoval realizaci. Veronika Muzik\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1 navrhla cel\u00fd interi\u00e9r od dispozice a materi\u00e1lov\u00e9ho \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed a\u017e po typov\u00fd a atypick\u00fd n\u00e1bytek. Eva Trs dr\u017eela rozpo\u010dty a objedn\u00e1vky, aby v\u0161e sed\u011blo tak\u00e9 v \u010d\u00edslech.\n\nD\u011bkujeme panu Pobudovi a cel\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu KAPITOL, a.s. za d\u016fv\u011bru a otev\u0159enou spolupr\u00e1ci.\n\nKlient: KAPITOL, a.s.\nN\u00e1vrh a realizace interi\u00e9ru: U1 space design\nT\u00fdm U1: Michal Gr\u00f3f, Veronika Muzik\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1, Eva Trs\nFotografie: Jan Kudej\n\nKter\u00fd detail podle v\u00e1s nejv\u00edc ovliv\u0148uje prvn\u00ed dojem z kancel\u00e1\u0159e?\n\n#u1spacedesign #officedesign #workplace #web","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/761200028_1701398885050779_6270727595696748162_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=cRwbMgV9GdoQ7kNvwGx62fb&_nc_oc=AdrhpfoVtoPJrbU4NhYCghZM4pLhP9gvpwYFb2jI8UAN3cQQ4t_7y20yEtvpWG0ISlA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQISUjyscY1aHL8oHp7VHO__kjRSgUJyBvDCPJDqCzFfYBAygdD4KO9g-MzU1lQc1bQSg-t6L5laSg&oh=00_AQEvNLsKbWWXXWSu_0Nt6qM0CR2liqtp5t3d0J7we2tEOw&oe=6A8DF9C9","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DbkQCyHjj_j\/","timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:35:11+0000"},{"id":"18067981736415260","caption":"Pro na\u0161eho klienta jsme v CTParku Borsk\u00e1 pole v Plzni prom\u011bnili pr\u00e1zdn\u00fd prostor v nov\u00e9 pracovn\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed.\n\nSou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed realizace byly tak\u00e9 dod\u00e1vky od na\u0161ich partner\u016f. Sklen\u011bn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky dodal LIKO-S International, koberce Shaw Contract a sv\u00edtidla i \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed osv\u011btlen\u00ed zajistil t\u00fdm U1 lighting. Celek jsme ale jako U1 space design space design dr\u017eeli v jedn\u00e9 koordinaci, jednom harmonogramu a jednom v\u00fdsledku.\n\nFotografie: Jan Kudej","media_type":"VIDEO","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/o1\/v\/t2\/f2\/m86\/AQN-eHSF_ze-Wdr6VZVk_6PS0IUrNThYqWbAnhp_PFfGUtjrtJohrJEYBmnw_8Ow_FGm0-LIq-0BzVLQVL3y-beHP7dSvHLWCCN9Gcw.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=vY0Ini5J4w0Q7kNvwHSzkL5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuMTI4MC5kYXNoX2Jhc2VsaW5lXzFfdjEiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE4NDA5MDk0ODUxMTQ0MzM5LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6NTgsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoxMCwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=7c61ff4d03e29721&_nc_&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIJ_1rAa6OZ0v2YUQSnxD6n6e2SkxPXoY8d9f_f0Ely6awSoepvMN3vAC4tBZXargFcuqi494fEwQ&oh=00_AQFlf4CCAU4UN1DBnr7rtxh53E9PctL934OM8WaMmKSpBQ&oe=6A89F292","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DZ7Lhi0jGN2\/","timestamp":"2026-06-23T10:15:43+0000","thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/730809274_18409094944144339_3365398831991845360_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=M2002LQTttYQ7kNvwEklpvM&_nc_oc=AdrBmjT2MLSBuLkKrWbSkZeiC7A8pF6plvYebCvNKRd9v7pVW5rkfnIV8k49bFgVmes&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKBV3t9RtW-2mHA24EHpfPDyOkbWjUrL06d7pUXMr3Rj3bNPRtre_LFj9oCpA2ouky33IBVC0YLGg&oh=00_AQEbM0eGY4hQNh8rHRR_lJG1bQDC8gOhlGaTkwGMoxRXYg&oe=6A8DF274"},{"id":"18112967890795357","caption":"Vyhr\u00e1li jsme Kancel\u00e1\u0159e roku 2025.\n\nProjekt Direct poji\u0161\u0165ovna Brno z\u00edskal 1. m\u00edsto v kategorii Velk\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e.\n\nPro U1 space design je to velk\u00e1 radost. A je\u0161t\u011b v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed potvrzen\u00ed toho, \u017ee kancel\u00e1\u0159 m\u00e1 fungovat nejen na fotk\u00e1ch, ale hlavn\u011b v ka\u017edodenn\u00edm provozu.\n\nPro Direct jsme v Brn\u011b vytvo\u0159ili nov\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed o velikosti 2 700 m\u00b2. Jedno patro, jeden provoz a t\u00fdmy pod jednou st\u0159echou.\n\nProjekt vznikal s jasn\u00fdm c\u00edlem: navrhnout pracovn\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kter\u00e9 bude dlouhodob\u011b funk\u010dn\u00ed po provozn\u00ed, technick\u00e9 i organiza\u010dn\u00ed str\u00e1nce. \u0158e\u0161ili jsme dispozici, akustiku, sv\u011btlo, materi\u00e1ly, povrchy, p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky, osv\u011btlen\u00ed i technick\u00e9 n\u00e1vaznosti. V\u0161echno jako jeden celek, ne jako soubor samostatn\u00fdch \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed.\n\nZa projektem st\u00e1l t\u00fdm U1 space design: Andrea Kali\u0161ov\u00e1 vedla obchodn\u00ed str\u00e1nku projektu a komunikaci s klientem. Franti\u0161ek Nov\u00e1k navrhl architektonick\u00fd koncept, design a materi\u00e1lov\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed. Ladislav Chl\u00e1dek m\u011bl na starosti technickou a projek\u010dn\u00ed koordinaci. Romana Ko\u010dkov\u00e1 odpov\u00eddala za ekonomiku projektu a rozpo\u010dtov\u00fd dohled. Otakar Hobza hl\u00eddal kvalitu p\u0159\u00edmo na stavb\u011b.\n\nD\u011bkujeme cel\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu Direct poji\u0161\u0165ovna, a.s. za d\u016fv\u011bru, otev\u0159enou spolupr\u00e1ci a profesion\u00e1ln\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstup. D\u011bkujeme tak\u00e9 sout\u011b\u017ei Kancel\u00e1\u0159e roku, porot\u011b, po\u0159adatelsk\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu a v\u0161em partner\u016fm.\n\nCena n\u00e1s t\u011b\u0161\u00ed. Nejv\u00edc si ale v\u00e1\u017e\u00edme toho, \u017ee p\u0159i\u0161la ve chv\u00edli, kdy prostor u\u017e n\u011bkolik m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f re\u00e1ln\u011b slou\u017e\u00ed lidem.\n\nProto\u017ee skute\u010dn\u00fd test kancel\u00e1\u0159e nep\u0159ijde prvn\u00ed den po focen\u00ed. P\u0159ijde po stovk\u00e1ch b\u011b\u017en\u00fdch pracovn\u00edch dn\u016f.\n\nA kdy\u017e prostor po\u0159\u00e1d funguje, d\u00e1v\u00e1 smysl a obstoj\u00ed v ka\u017edodenn\u00edm provozu, je to pro n\u00e1s ta nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdhra.\n\nFotografie: Ing. arch. Martina Pit\u00e1kov\u00e1\n\n#u1spacedesign #direct #kancelareroku #officedesign #workplacedesign #interiordesign #interiorarchitecture #officefitout #brno #fitout #projectmanagement #web","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/723458208_18408012175144339_4187561138325667277_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=I8qMn1tGn1cQ7kNvwGasj1b&_nc_oc=AdotR4RF_ECNTpSRo9CJyTWVKMMyQcjoPsUh_BzU-h3UVkjacaw8C_ytIs9unU4kYpE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIb0HMSv24yOAe2uaKVgkJZOuOfWsjC1sUwr105x-gHhv_63FlzVAkDuWsIpR7KpBCEFz7jMciODQ&oh=00_AQGME7phPxMUS8wwQVMinV10EugSRNx95se3COOr_xvIIQ&oe=6A8DE187","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DZpTxWeDY_Z\/","timestamp":"2026-06-16T11:41:10+0000"},{"id":"18201452053359276","caption":"Pro brn\u011bnskou provozovnu\u00a0FCC \u010cesk\u00e1 republika, kter\u00e1 je sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed skupiny @fcc_environment_cee jsme vytvo\u0159ili prostor, kter\u00fd se p\u0159izp\u016fsob\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdm typ\u016fm setk\u00e1n\u00ed.\nD\u00edky p\u0159\u00ed\u010dk\u00e1m (@likos_international) m\u016f\u017ee fungovat jako v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed jednac\u00ed m\u00edstnost, nebo se rozd\u011blit na men\u0161\u00ed \u010d\u00e1sti pro v\u00edce t\u00fdm\u016f najednou.\n\nPromy\u0161len\u00fd detail.\nPraktick\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed.\nProstor, kter\u00fd funguje ka\u017ed\u00fd den.\n\nFotografie: Ing. arch. Martina Pit\u00e1kov\u00e1","media_type":"VIDEO","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/o1\/v\/t2\/f2\/m86\/AQOkQvEZ147wpFOBUAuPkH3nqOj2gvfZn__TEmVOLZ8_6ZY8jvVNxWRBMiHO7X56BC-WDd3pysbYa3QfaC4DOHZIPuv-MvWV6EQMLOI.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=Y22gJu6qKQsQ7kNvwGVsDs7&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTAwODMwNTE0MTg2Nzg3MCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjk0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6OCwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=b1f04cbb399edd4c&_nc_&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIdfI9ru2JG5Ewbm7DqpR7WRgHQML1qVURah8qKJ-PdpCI3_DsFq8ygyRwu5w2UkFBGqccMXxWJQg&oh=00_AQHwTjuPZkRRyV3co_MWeaTrF9LSgWNGGD5CJx1IF1JdVA&oe=6A89DDD8","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DYgyjVqNq-W\/","timestamp":"2026-05-19T07:49:32+0000","thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/702847204_18403884838144339_9119215144147732644_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=Rt9_SjRIjJkQ7kNvwGjmRAc&_nc_oc=Adp9GC6N8SUP1kmTIF8k4pkny-BMM9bawjvi5NNxoRJDyAsqCe5UIsRCM1V-5RucdVY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIeJAr6HoYkjYuZrvOokMLAkP2uaZGT8_fc9LDAhVnPGpvlQYBEz3AQWTPWVEFffl_JrOr29sdFRQ&oh=00_AQHxcyJQDr8XQ_nDANDXLHgPk9DP9CSAtKc3TomwsUhFyA&oe=6A8DE9D2"},{"id":"17914193364389893","caption":"@u1space_design dokon\u010dil realizaci pro @fcc_environment_cee, prvn\u00ed t\u0159i etapy rekonstrukce kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00fdch prostor pro FCC \u010cesk\u00e1 republika, provozovna Brno.\n\nC\u00edlem bylo vytvo\u0159it interi\u00e9r, kter\u00fd odpov\u00edd\u00e1 ka\u017edodenn\u00edmu provozu spole\u010dnosti p\u016fsob\u00edc\u00ed v oblasti odpadov\u00e9ho hospod\u00e1\u0159stv\u00ed a z\u00e1rove\u0148 posouv\u00e1 kvalitu pracovn\u00edho prost\u0159ed\u00ed. Recepce, zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnosti, kancel\u00e1\u0159e i z\u00e1zem\u00ed, tedy toalety a kuchy\u0148ka, dohromady tvo\u0159\u00ed jeden kompaktn\u00ed a srozumiteln\u00fd celek.\n\nRealizaci jsme postavili na dvou rovin\u00e1ch:\n\nProvozn\u00ed hledisko\nRecepce vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed prvn\u00ed kontakt s n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edky, zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnosti zvl\u00e1daj\u00ed b\u011b\u017en\u00e9 porady i v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed jedn\u00e1n\u00ed. Posuvn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky od @likos_international umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed prostor podle pot\u0159eby rozd\u011blit nebo propojit. Materi\u00e1ly jsou vybran\u00e9 s ohledem na dlouhodobou z\u00e1t\u011b\u017e a ka\u017edodenn\u00ed pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed.\n\nProst\u0159ed\u00ed\nNov\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e nab\u00edzej\u00ed zam\u011bstnanc\u016fm lep\u0161\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed pro ka\u017edodenn\u00ed pr\u00e1ci. D\u016fraz je kladen\u00fd na p\u0159irozenou orientaci v prostoru, klidnou atmosf\u00e9ru a \u010dist\u00fd detail, kter\u00fd dr\u017e\u00ed kvalitu i po m\u011bs\u00edc\u00edch provozu.\n\nV\u00fdsledkem jsou kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 prostory FCC v Brn\u011b, kter\u00e9 spojuj\u00ed funk\u010dn\u00ed \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed, kvalitn\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed pro t\u00fdm a klidn\u00fd architektonick\u00fd v\u00fdraz.\n\nKlient: FCC \u010cesk\u00e1 republika, provozovna Brno\n\nD\u011bkujeme spole\u010dnosti @fcc_environment_cee za dlouhodobou d\u016fv\u011bru, spole\u010dnosti @likos_international \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed posuvn\u00fdch p\u0159\u00ed\u010dek.\n\nT\u00fdm U1:\nAndrea Kali\u0161ov\u00e1, obchodn\u00ed veden\u00ed projektu\nEva Trs, business support\nVeronika Muzik\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1, n\u00e1vrh designu\nMartin \u010cuhel, veden\u00ed realizace\n\nFotografie: Ing. arch. Martina Pit\u00e1kov\u00e1","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/702306532_18403866751144339_3575979953074248996_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=6h5Ycvizd3YQ7kNvwEBJ41o&_nc_oc=AdrxsBeSyh7IVhrAQG74gh9DXvjmZkiqW_t6PKeTys5U2Ze2Q4i1NhWSyNcxjf2hw50&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKFIgnfrxRfQSY5ik9HjiVTfn6pdJzLcjKngMizSEg2xgezvneADy4dabIe65UPmF3uIMFF89w0Ag&oh=00_AQFcdVmVnEcZrHBNf77JecbeiH-yWb9hrx9s7QUOAVA8qw&oe=6A8DDB13","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DYgud74DRbQ\/","timestamp":"2026-05-19T07:09:53+0000"},{"id":"18069650312679535","caption":"Jedna z na\u0161ich dokon\u010den\u00fdch realizac\u00ed, ke kter\u00e9 se vrac\u00edme s odstupem: kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 prostory pro @direct.pojistovna v brn\u011bnsk\u00e9m komplexu Titania, celkem 2 700 m\u00b2.\n\nZad\u00e1n\u00ed bylo jasn\u00e9. Sjednotit t\u00fdmy do jednoho patra a vytvo\u0159it prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kter\u00e9 bude dob\u0159e slou\u017eit denn\u00edmu provozu i za p\u00e1r let. Spojili jsme proto rekonstrukci se stavebn\u00edmi \u00fapravami a od za\u010d\u00e1tku pracovali s dispozic\u00ed, akustikou, povrchy, p\u0159\u00ed\u010dkami i osv\u011btlen\u00edm jako s jedn\u00edm celkem.\n\nProv\u00e1zanost\nJednotliv\u00e1 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed nestoj\u00ed vedle sebe, ale navazuj\u00ed na sebe. Sklen\u011bn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky od @likos_international , akustick\u00e1 opat\u0159en\u00ed i materi\u00e1ly jsme ladili spole\u010dn\u011b, aby prostor p\u016fsobil sjednocen\u011b a fungoval jako jeden celek.\n\nEtapizace\nRealizovali jsme po f\u00e1z\u00edch podle pevn\u00e9ho harmonogramu. Nejd\u0159\u00edv prvn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st prostoru, pak postupn\u011b zbytek za \u010d\u00e1ste\u010dn\u00e9ho provozu. Bez p\u0159esn\u00e9 koordinace profes\u00ed a dodavatel\u016f by to ne\u0161lo, stejn\u011b jako bez schopnosti pru\u017en\u011b reagovat na provozn\u00ed omezen\u00ed.\n\nV\u00fdsledkem je kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kter\u00e9 dr\u017e\u00ed jednotnou kvalitu, funguje jako celek a obstoj\u00ed v ka\u017edodenn\u00edm provozu.\n\nKlient: Direct poji\u0161\u0165ovna, a.s. (Brno, komplex Titania)\nRealizace interi\u00e9ru & technick\u00fd design: U1 space design\nTechnick\u00fd dozor: @otakarhobza \nT\u00fdm U1: Andrea Kali\u0161ov\u00e1, Franti\u0161ek Nov\u00e1k, Ladislav Chl\u00e1dek, Romana Ko\u010dkov\u00e1\n\nFotografie: Ing. arch. Martina Pit\u00e1kov\u00e1","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/684268863_18402074491144339_1401769445648570983_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=FS6vA_sO2LAQ7kNvwFuwu9P&_nc_oc=Adope-HtytKJVim9LC9d_ZFcwOA6Sb5atwbalfYcKcLZR8y6QSzbuKTYMh-MxEziyPY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK0JoBhwliJAeFlkESZIm1Y8JYmVG44ZwIMzW1u8Fce5T_0tm2jtlrmmUsmceqQiUJ0-qNd2cmzTA&oh=00_AQHtEwrlPWfZN1jhPxXqQfIj55r6Bd6Ck-tBHCp2pEjVEw&oe=6A8DD76D","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DX_vuA5jVVO\/","timestamp":"2026-05-06T11:45:53+0000"},{"id":"18020185997821469","caption":"Rozhodnut\u00ed o \u017eidli netrv\u00e1 dlouho.\nD\u016fsledky ano.\n\nV\u00fdb\u011br podle katalogu nebo kr\u00e1tk\u00e9ho vyzkou\u0161en\u00ed v showroomu nesta\u010d\u00ed.\nRozd\u00edly nejsou vid\u011bt hned. Jsou vevnit\u0159.\n\nHustota p\u011bny.\nKvalita konstrukce.\nZp\u016fsob v\u00fdroby.\n\nPo roce pozn\u00e1\u0161 rozd\u00edl.\nBu\u010f \u017eidle dr\u017e\u00ed tvar a podporu.\nNebo t\u011b za\u010dne bolet z\u00e1da.\n\nProto nevyb\u00edr\u00e1me od stolu.\nJezd\u00edme do v\u00fdroby.\nOv\u011b\u0159ujeme v\u011bci, kter\u00e9 v showroomu neuvid\u00ed\u0161.\n\nNe\u0159e\u0161\u00edme jen design.\n\u0158e\u0161\u00edme, co s lidmi ud\u011bl\u00e1 8 hodin denn\u011b.\n\nKancel\u00e1\u0159n\u00ed \u017eidle nen\u00ed detail.\nJe to ka\u017edodenn\u00ed n\u00e1stroj.\n\n#u1spacedesign #officefitout #workspace #ergonomie","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/671199150_18399856462144339_4185478197926346674_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=RkiaD0KICHQQ7kNvwG_np1v&_nc_oc=Adrc0kjdmvXo8qwpq0B_Hw4a0BuaDDiqFroq6QgLNLo-xI1qtHhqDDVULuoC2EAaOMY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLIrK815at8P2604XRDd1CwZavrgI2--o1R54l1vhRvoZwLkP1zzrHx8F5sD3vhZxMFtMWAhiIQ8A&oh=00_AQEQF4kRIj1VoQYYqi8tAm6xammfr09H9hvhtVtJN61DJg&oe=6A8DC6FC","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DXZUL6kjfoT\/","timestamp":"2026-04-21T13:34:10+0000"},{"id":"17855137326689723","caption":"Rekonstrukce Restaurace Evropa pro Volarezu vrac\u00ed historick\u00e9mu prostoru jeho v\u00fdraz a z\u00e1rove\u0148 ho p\u0159ipravuje na ka\u017edodenn\u00ed provoz bez kompromis\u016f.\n\nNe\u0161lo jen o estetiku, ale o p\u0159esn\u00e9 napojen\u00ed historie na sou\u010dasn\u00e9 fungov\u00e1n\u00ed. V\u00fdsledn\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed stoj\u00ed na dvou rovin\u00e1ch:\n\n\u0158emeslo\nVznikla v\u011brn\u00e1 replika vstupn\u00edch dve\u0159\u00ed pod dohledem pam\u00e1tk\u00e1\u0159\u016f, v\u010detn\u011b detail\u016f profilace a kov\u00e1n\u00ed. Kazetov\u00fd strop d\u00e1v\u00e1 prostoru rytmus a z\u00e1rove\u0148 \u0159e\u0161\u00ed akustiku i technick\u00e9 n\u00e1vaznosti.\n\nSou\u010dasnost\nKlasick\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly dopl\u0148uj\u00ed sou\u010dasn\u00e9 prvky. Bar s obkladem z trap\u00e9zov\u00e9ho plechu nebo sklen\u011bn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dky s potiskem dobov\u00fdch motiv\u016f p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161ej\u00ed kontrast i variabilitu prostoru.\n\nZa n\u00e1vrhem stoj\u00ed Atelier Dimense (@dimense_architects)\n\nV\u00fdsledkem je prostor, kter\u00fd p\u016fsob\u00ed p\u0159irozen\u011b, klidn\u011b a zvl\u00e1d\u00e1 i n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00fd provoz.\n\nKlient: @volareza (Ministerstvo obrany) \nN\u00e1vrh a projekt: Atelier Dimense\nRealizace interi\u00e9ru & technick\u00fd design: U1 space design\nT\u00fdm U1: Petr Dohnal, Tereza Maty\u00e1\u0161kov\u00e1, Martin \u010cuhel, Tom\u00e1\u0161 Loup Fotografie: Tom\u00e1\u0161 Lumpe","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/660410102_18397867816144339_3414046073934685417_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=F63_TC9jKDgQ7kNvwG3xwhh&_nc_oc=AdoYFlzko0-3xcA2wQIRQUVcztdrcfnc9G-UsXH7qwqsvojfv_Bewx2xxWJgYtz1kzI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLYEgB2cZdK4KMhhOLm8JbfV5j9rd8ad5B52lylB3njWVfcQZ2MMTy6MK-21m3EVg8qs8ZFlAcgcg&oh=00_AQH56d460h-dQj-4g4jIeI-L8IICpQF8nEBXbsqURsQPcA&oe=6A8DD618","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DW1CyoLjS7C\/","timestamp":"2026-04-07T11:29:30+0000"},{"id":"18110546620577953","caption":"Od vstupn\u00ed haly a\u017e po firemn\u00ed stravov\u00e1n\u00ed.\nModernizace prostor pro Hartmann Rico (@hartmann_cz) prom\u011bnila st\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed ve funk\u010dn\u00ed a vizu\u00e1ln\u011b sjednocen\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kter\u00e9 odpov\u00edd\u00e1 v\u00fdznamu mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed zdravotnick\u00e9 skupiny.\n\nHlavn\u00ed v\u00fdzvou bylo sladit reprezentativn\u00ed charakter prostor s ka\u017edodenn\u00edm provozem. Realizaci jsme rozd\u011blili do dvou etap:\n\nReprezentace\nNov\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed recepce a lobby dopl\u0148uje multifunk\u010dn\u00ed zasedac\u00ed m\u00edstnost s d\u016frazem na akustiku a ergonomii.\n\nKomfort\nRevitalizace j\u00eddelny nav\u00fd\u0161ila kapacitu a p\u0159inesla odoln\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly p\u0159ipraven\u00e9 na ka\u017edodenn\u00ed z\u00e1t\u011b\u017e.\n\nV\u00fdsledkem je interi\u00e9r, kter\u00fd podporuje plynul\u00fd chod firmy a sou\u010dasn\u011b posiluje vn\u00edm\u00e1n\u00ed zna\u010dky.\n\nKlient: Hartmann Rico, \u010dlen skupiny HARTMANN\nT\u00fdm - U1 space design: Andrea Kali\u0161ov\u00e1, Filip Dr\u00e1pal, Ladislav Chl\u00e1dek, Eva Trs","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/627055792_18387293641144339_6008902907960361920_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=yrxegFxtPvMQ7kNvwGcb2mR&_nc_oc=AdpSCQ4h53tklRFavZsssp_563mKx5StZSIF8sBB_P4rLiEkQHqdk2gbCgtiyJ_5BIE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJ85zrQMJfGXZLGcoO1jfMxVQErWDI3xzSBZesSsYI_O40aiRGPZSw2nPxEBryCDAC2USW8pY3Jqg&oh=00_AQGWwgohuFAW-H8zoNhnxNz2itF9O7PLoYW8H_8JIc2n0g&oe=6A8DC429","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DUQpo19DcnU\/","timestamp":"2026-02-02T15:14:16+0000"},{"id":"18067669661149547","caption":"P\u0159ejeme v\u00e1m v\u0161em kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 pro\u017eit\u00ed v\u00e1no\u010dn\u00edch sv\u00e1tk\u016f. A\u0165 jsou p\u0159esn\u011b takov\u00e9, jak\u00e9 je m\u00e1te r\u00e1di, pln\u00e9 klidu, dobr\u00e9ho j\u00eddla a sm\u00edchu.\n\n\u0160\u0165astn\u00e9 a vesel\u00e9 p\u0159eje U1 space design","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/605617606_18382022137144339_4349789050286550999_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=TfLLg9xPQ7YQ7kNvwHB1JYR&_nc_oc=Adq9hsRX2wsoNJE9B9XnzgXDT9xNV9bzA8p1-1oJ59I2s0jZ9Sn_t-kN4mOWJdK80X4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLlUHhviTAfx6ewLd-bQ0aTrOiAWPRRST5c-7TiHfYlwZUdgfzL2ulQJzq-uaZCz5yhXMXEFoPxVA&oh=00_AQHVzpd2V_4s4qHRcwuEJ-EYekFZRISQEAkjRV6Nac6MWw&oe=6A8DF12E","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DSp2q4qDSGn\/","timestamp":"2025-12-24T17:06:22+0000"},{"id":"18114543367585817","caption":"Architektura, kter\u00e1 nez\u016fstala v \u0161upl\u00edku. \r\nTvo\u0159\u00edme prostory, kter\u00e9 z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed. Ale jako hlavn\u00ed partner Fashion Show Vodojemy (Open Fashion Studios \/ TIC Brno) jsme cht\u011bli o\u017eivit i to, co po odevzd\u00e1n\u00ed zak\u00e1zek obvykle kon\u010d\u00ed v archivu.\r\nVzali jsme \u201cpap\u00edrov\u00e1n\u00ed\u201d doslova.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Swipe pro cel\u00fd p\u0159\u00edb\u011bh:\r\n\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 hedv\u00e1b\u00ed ani bavlna, jen na\u0161e projekty na pap\u00edrech a pauz\u00e1ku. Korzet z pauz\u00e1ku a sukn\u011b z p\u016fdorys\u016f, kter\u00e9 se rozvlnily v podzem\u00ed Brna. Od skici a\u017e po fin\u00e1ln\u00ed st\u0159ih \r\nDali jsme pl\u00e1n\u016fm druhou \u0161anci. Na mole.\r\nBav\u00ed v\u00e1s tenhle crossover architektury a m\u00f3dy? Dejte n\u00e1m v\u011bd\u011bt! \ud83d\udc47\r\n\u2014 Credits: \r\nKoncept:@bohacekxx (U1) \r\nDesign & Realizace: @honxza & @gwynsew \r\nModel: @marketa_vykourilova Prostory: @vodojemyzlutykopec Po\u0159adatel\u00e9: @open_fashion_brno @ticbrno Support: @drapalova_jitka\r\nD\u00edky cel\u00e9mu t\u00fdmu & foto: @olo_dressing @alesseliga @jarmilakrahulcova @silvie_seborova @kivaphotography\r\n#U1SpaceDesign #ArchitectureWear #FashionShowVodojemy #TICBrno #PaperFashion #UpcyclingArchitecture #BrnoDesign #JanVetchy #Brno","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/589292754_18379469920144339_6351131755148012055_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=dIleq4ZH3p0Q7kNvwEOZiFB&_nc_oc=Adpf9bkjLd2X64n6fPhrbUse8E-SDM_ue4kLUdbWvCMWBgX3pTb3vYSltXMsBnlT2M4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLrojl39oR7vkOOSpyiUXwa2g9STiA84u1eU_rjUUE32dRqvcvrZDWS1ZxGYGSEYJTSbENqtUd1Yw&oh=00_AQGPL6iKPLDtSlI04_MaSNgQlzBiKury6g3_Lp0FpsdOvw&oe=6A8DE13E","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DRuHO3CDd4G\/","timestamp":"2025-12-01T12:16:39+0000"},{"id":"18022710830785234","caption":"Kdy\u017e se pl\u00e1ny utrhnou ze \u0159et\u011bzu.","media_type":"VIDEO","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/o1\/v\/t2\/f2\/m86\/AQNp2STJmsyxO-aY549gLNFQ2wyPmA52mz-olC-Ay84LnGEbX0HuJLn44nzF-hWaaShillblYTsGFpi1haTyLIlDfCduK8Mi8e5-DMQ.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=uKklTBsrJd4Q7kNvwELrxP_&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM2OTAyNDc2MDc0ODYzNywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjI2MywidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAwOTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjE5LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=90b0e352570f96d2&_nc_-4EFQIoAkMzLBdAM92yLQ5WBBgSZGFzaF9iYXNlbGluZV8xX3YxEQB1_gdl5p0BAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKe8_b7bS9b5FlkCs-qzyRleu8Um9ca40T4xgu_8GN7B4emnf9O9rMyE5Wt_PkW6-L5hP0frQWo8g&oh=00_AQH5s3VEcRUSg3_8nEbDylFlOEaEonHkJIkEA2tx-pFkNg&oe=6A89EEED","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DRsOU5QjdgT\/","timestamp":"2025-11-30T18:46:11+0000","thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.71878-15\/589151792_1817978965485927_1257795041376370586_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=2L300VPFsoQQ7kNvwHZQp2n&_nc_oc=AdqdkowdGKkx11rZvu0-YLCMhVX0-ICJxJcf41vdUihbfKP4c6mBRKZMV7SkqRU-798&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKP_n0VR5fojX8k3Q4ugKhiY2CcQMu6JzQ4A6YXYQHa7FkFk-aqBW89Cl3zCZqk014epaJHCJRg6g&oh=00_AQFea_of1mN-iluF8lEneQhgqhPY05JovFGbvLKqP3ofEw&oe=6A8DE9FB"},{"id":"18070184942598378","caption":"Otev\u0159\u00edt, nebo zav\u0159\u00edt? \n\nSpole\u010densk\u00e1 z\u00f3na v nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00edch @direct.pojistovna umo\u017e\u0148uje skoro a\u017e nekone\u010dn\u00e9 mo\u017enosti uspo\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed. Direc\u0165\u00e1ci tady zvl\u00e1dnou celofiremn\u00ed \u0161kolen\u00ed, neform\u00e1ln\u00ed firemn\u00ed ve\u010d\u00edrky i setk\u00e1n\u00ed s partnery. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/568407676_1450572483466755_2552633937951126841_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=MImjn4ZAaAQQ7kNvwFqb6Nx&_nc_oc=AdrwDAzFUj37B3hOJGvW2QNEnmP8qfAezY447HHyfiX0onV6pm2wS5T1Zj3mn4Qe9Tc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLCNzYrt7nhvqajpBlJ0FKqEMZ7Se9iwd2-FIsKqOMeX-0x3a1mvXVDQgyrRti95IJMa5exAJo6Pg&oh=00_AQHLSfSmLvS5XPJ1waH_vP5diqu_2hPVgYZJsDaMMmamuw&oe=6A8DD46E","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DQoeJyEDQfZ\/","timestamp":"2025-11-04T11:10:06+0000"},{"id":"17988880589728681","caption":"Kancel\u00e1\u0159e Portiva, to je elegance, komfort a d\u016fraz na perfektn\u00ed reprezentaci hodnot spole\u010dnosti.\ud83d\udc47\n\nProstor navrhlo studio perspektiv a my jsme se postarali o jeho realizaci a dod\u00e1vku interierov\u00e9ho vybaven\u00ed.\n\nPodivejte se na v\u0161echny fotky t\u00e9to nad\u010dasov\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e na na\u0161em webu.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/557017500_1429305375593466_2685637202895380855_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=H-LpxHOEIioQ7kNvwFSQMY-&_nc_oc=Adr0oAZz4K2Xo7F8fE-pu0rUxtOzOg8avBF9LOugCafA64Gaq426_XbTWYeSd6XqBpM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJzqkKGkfL0NQhLBSBygqv5yETOg1iRtT5kcguWbpgQ3ipECByakSX87NGoBO4PykD20j8_FYehyw&oh=00_AQGzR38uAkKhYSLPrNDfCJYuqCq1DRurj74xIffAVsPdcg&oe=6A8DF802","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DQUFLsAEQw-\/","timestamp":"2025-10-27T13:07:06+0000"},{"id":"18361725553088075","caption":"Pro Continental jsme ve spolupr\u00e1ci s extern\u00edmi architekty vytvo\u0159ili z\u00e1zem\u00ed a prostor recepce pro pobo\u010dku v Brand\u00fdse.\n\nD\u00edky pou\u017eit\u00ed tepl\u00fdch barev, p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f a sofistikovan\u00e9ho osv\u011btlen\u00ed vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed prostor p\u0159\u00e1telskou a p\u0159\u00edjemnou atmosf\u00e9ru, kter\u00e1 odr\u00e1\u017e\u00ed firemn\u00ed kulturu spole\u010dnosti. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/557430360_1429302655593738_3182808372988522779_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=LjotnDzNmqgQ7kNvwHKsiik&_nc_oc=AdpnqZvmulx6v_Mk3c5mbyimwEBIHKYi_GVEKgtYM1S1HAmdgQ6Z4nGdWamqfFrbolM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLpMtte1kcNsspW6A8YK8PxBKoW4_lltp0PlxhlMuJ6FmRKsuEpDVGiCuV4-b_uisB7dJ5ZzvUDVw&oh=00_AQHixXEQhC7y6xRxV_MoCZaXeoVUyuNGoWOtUEZ9tm_ctg&oe=6A8DEBED","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DQHF_1IDv5a\/","timestamp":"2025-10-22T12:04:06+0000"},{"id":"17860689630510348","caption":"V Ostrav\u011b najdete jedine\u010dn\u00fd komunitn\u00ed pracovn\u00ed prostor - Clubhouse. Komunit\u011b v CTP Axis Office Parku nab\u00edz\u00ed prostor pro setk\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed, vzd\u011bl\u00e1vac\u00ed aktivity a spole\u010densk\u00e1 setk\u00e1n\u00ed. \ud83e\udd42\n\nV\u00fdrazn\u00e9 podlahy vlo\u017een\u00e9 do industri\u00e1ln\u00edho prostoru dod\u00e1vaj\u00ed m\u00edstu unik\u00e1tn\u00ed atmosf\u00e9ru, kterou najdete m\u00e1lokde.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/556144383_1429299885594015_237811576663996305_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=8a1N2LhnEcEQ7kNvwHBMioR&_nc_oc=AdrfYH6BDP28bYctRiqQ0uNDnYlT2DSFk1s4nP_mQyls8fiHq29GJoVNNmzHFDqPhYE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKZj36O6Dx6xFB2GRgj7pCdZPmLsM-Ce7MfJ_ZyNr5m6h9clG4uTAAGacbRNiRggUZTIbgc-GiSMQ&oh=00_AQE5x7ss4AfJfPJniZJRoCvzwpi2wsAWmBUAUPdVr15_kQ&oe=6A8DD0A2","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DP1D3ISDdBp\/","timestamp":"2025-10-15T11:59:06+0000"},{"id":"18039076103695829","caption":"V kancel\u00e1\u0159i Atlas Copco naraz\u00edte krom\u011b spousty zelen\u011b tak\u00e9 na zaj\u00edmav\u00e1 sv\u011bteln\u00e1 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed a spoustu locker\u016f, kter\u00e9 odd\u011bluj\u00ed pracovn\u00ed z\u00f3nu od t\u00e9 spole\u010densk\u00e9. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/558207549_1429297585594245_5554084884091499499_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=NlWEgDQjNGQQ7kNvwE1skG7&_nc_oc=Adpa1FImQhnDlzviAf6KAlKCXWWkw6ULhh50bSoKBqMSbYKKDRaEuIIkjyUv0MfU5OQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKbDXGU_mrvmPc_eXVafGYorHQPTd_Y0S2b2ela0bMz4N5Bhz93G8XUzK3KRXK6fR3ze6cOHLg26g&oh=00_AQGbAVohzYawj8T0EHktRmuDJ51Q3mrQw53sEwdDAW6YiA&oe=6A8DD7EA","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DPgdKM6iTei\/","timestamp":"2025-10-07T11:56:07+0000"},{"id":"18060083183127211","caption":"Pro Dekstone p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed k\u00e1men s.r.o. jsme se v roce 2022 postarali o realizaci interi\u00e9ru novostavby s\u00eddla spole\u010dnosti. A ten u\u017e na prvn\u00ed pohled napov\u00ed, \u010d\u00edm se spole\u010dnost zab\u00fdv\u00e1. \ud83d\udc47\n\nIkonick\u00e1 fotka recepce nav\u00edc u\u017e n\u011bjak\u00fd ten rok zdob\u00ed n\u00e1\u0161 web. \ud83e\udd42","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/557671905_1429294562261214_7766510421969778403_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Ta-FT8YfK88Q7kNvwHXBZjV&_nc_oc=AdrFUW4AkMOFg2-CnAdqKHWMnrsWYY10pVoE-GssObS4CbM5xnMou3XLmidrJ6uwS5E&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKB6_39rKSk9ENjn_VqXU69CP5mapWlgkULTaAG3eQBBXxowbp8_dBNVIkFz7UGutVzeT5pFk9nKA&oh=00_AQGGlRYdLm7_8ltc68JOWTFeUHG4KC1EmOsXVXOTh-2rPg&oe=6A8DCF44","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DPTQAxCjI9X\/","timestamp":"2025-10-02T08:51:06+0000"},{"id":"18073334009172854","caption":"Hlavn\u00edm tah\u00e1kem interi\u00e9ru s\u00eddla spole\u010dnosti Trikaya, kter\u00fd jsme u\u017e v roce 2020 realizovali v jedn\u00e9 z ikonick\u00fdch budov zn\u00e1m\u00fdch jako brn\u011bnsk\u00e1 troj\u010data, jsou zachovan\u00e9 \u017eelezobetonov\u00e9 konstrukce, kter\u00e9 p\u0159id\u00e1vaj\u00ed prostoru industri\u00e1ln\u00ed charakter. \ud83c\udfed\n\nKontrast b\u00edl\u00e9 a \u010dern\u00e9, d\u0159evo a vyu\u017eit\u00ed firemn\u00ed \u010derven\u00e9 pak dotv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed konzistentn\u00ed a profesion\u00e1ln\u00ed vzhled cel\u00e9ho prostoru. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/556034219_1429290985594905_581441035585679325_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=AiQiliUHxqAQ7kNvwG-mNjT&_nc_oc=AdrzRK6p6634bpwUp-FQ9eyLXCRo-8QlOIZVpc36p7a4xG4_6yMvvuhI2RnMaDm6kcM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK2Fte_-Gpd6tGAyg8Dqv8PYzUTb6ylgh3Dqfy4IPnG7HAOb30vpZgT2yPpQi0f3z-azERdxxK1AQ&oh=00_AQFYqU5Tb2God9g0FMuTC9YKxUVFX7W-wmtGAKmDJAsPFg&oe=6A8DE99E","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DPOakGsiZTW\/","timestamp":"2025-09-30T11:47:06+0000"},{"id":"18263720572304139","caption":"I zna\u010dka Proud m\u00e1 v nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00edch Plze\u0148sk\u00e9ho Prazdroje sv\u00e9 m\u00edsto.\ud83d\udc47\n\nMrkn\u011bte se na tyhle zaj\u00edmav\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159e, kde jsme pom\u00e1hali se samotnou realizac\u00ed a dodali jsme opravdu hodn\u011b atypick\u00e9ho n\u00e1bytku, kter\u00fd do prostoru p\u0159esn\u011b zapadl na na\u0161em webu.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/550729275_1423918759465461_1323464049985536350_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ypSuPlL3GkgQ7kNvwEca6pD&_nc_oc=AdoAcMPtsh-v5nRmcPWP0XJ2gzcC0z8oy9SNg2UyJvl5CJ8gMPvn5PB-PvyklP6bw5s&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKKjBG1yzDhe9BlN2uqGd8wp2EkHF7DA_o7kv-iIT3Cza01tCN9AoftOKd11GlaSczKTtH48L32Jg&oh=00_AQEu17FSOU7rMw7ykui2oZ4ZTnekrgyb23xU0iLn7CfdkQ&oe=6A8DF053","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DO8NoCmjfgJ\/","timestamp":"2025-09-23T10:07:43+0000"},{"id":"18090182593763407","caption":"Finance pod jednou st\u0159echou. Design taky. \ud83d\udc4f\n\nPro YD Capital jsme zrekonstruovali kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 prostory v brn\u011bnsk\u00e9m Campus Science Parku \u2013 od bour\u00e1n\u00ed po vybaven\u00ed.\n\nDesign vych\u00e1z\u00ed z firemn\u00ed filozofie \u201ed\u00e1vat pen\u011bz\u016fm smysl\u201c. J\u00e1dro prostoru, kolem kter\u00e9ho se odehr\u00e1v\u00e1 ve\u0161ker\u00e9 d\u011bn\u00ed, je ztv\u00e1rn\u011bno v n\u00e1dechu zlat\u00e9 \u2013 jako vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed metafora hodnoty. \n\nD\u0159ev\u011bn\u00e9 podhledy a jednotn\u00e1 podlaha propojuj\u00ed z\u00f3ny do jednoho funk\u010dn\u00edho celku, j\u00eddelna se skrze sklen\u011bnou p\u0159\u00ed\u010dku otev\u00edr\u00e1 do prostoru a nevy\u010dn\u00edv\u00e1 z kontextu.\n\nV\u00fdsledek? Prostor, kter\u00fd spojuje logiku, estetiku i filozofii zna\u010dky. \n\n\ud83d\udc49 Mrkn\u011bte na v\u0161echny fotky t\u00e9to zlat\u00e9 realizace na webu.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/551092629_1420443293146341_1116006395302049610_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=OYKk6ZyhNbcQ7kNvwEmKskP&_nc_oc=AdoBhGSmP-dtv1Irk0oxPLvTBgK2coQsULt1nZ8yUBtU85vF1-yhC4OaeuPt6yn-_Ew&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIBylJ-iCw8jbDXW_diEEx51T9bM09TG1BePVm3aEKlgx1txU_v_Wowejb8QBTwUdYkrpEWUh9Fgw&oh=00_AQEFAN7ocn4iPY3bpitDuwZUFRiryycAjuyShLYQ9u7g0w&oe=6A8DDCC1","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DOySn0iDXhu\/","timestamp":"2025-09-19T13:38:58+0000"},{"id":"18097477885714794","caption":"P\u0159es 1 900 plechovek od piva? \ud83c\udf7a\n\nI to najdete v nov\u00fdch kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00edch Plze\u0148sk\u00e9ho Prazdroje. Prostor vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 mnoh\u00e9 prvky spojen\u00e9 s pivn\u00ed kulturou, a na plechovky se samoz\u0159ejm\u011b nesm\u011blo zapomenout. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/548925896_1416720386851965_7924608507279727642_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=NHdMIMeMdOUQ7kNvwFeOeaF&_nc_oc=Adpo28wUdr6FW3CfjvoA5SIVniErTGGDmww7N3UJhms3qzLGy7DqJ7RCNHEQAHU34Do&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK605fRmJNfk2hv_8oaU7vuzWriURWkM6mxPkEwgiGg4UKdhQKv8yJ7vPyEXnQLLtBlcSZIhcmcJA&oh=00_AQGXUNzR2Jj-tP-3zLCnWK4P0JSXaBYVNzlgwwhjfT7ADg&oe=6A8DF131","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DOntOnhjU8i\/","timestamp":"2025-09-15T10:59:48+0000"},{"id":"17844667743543185","caption":"LOBEY Laboratories je zna\u010dka pln\u00e1 energie, p\u0159\u00edrody a hravosti. A p\u0159esn\u011b takov\u00e9 jsou i jejich kancel\u00e1\u0159e v brn\u011bnsk\u00e9m Spielberk Office Center. \ud83d\udc4f\n\nRozmanit\u00e9 z\u00f3ny, p\u0159irozen\u00e9 sv\u011btlo, v\u00fdhled na m\u011bsto a prostorn\u00e1 terasa. To v\u0161echno dohromady vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed m\u00edsto, kde je radost b\u00fdt \u2013 a tvo\u0159it. Interi\u00e9r, kter\u00fd jsme navrhli na m\u00edru filozofii LOBEY podporuje kreativitu, otev\u0159enost i ka\u017edodenn\u00ed pohodu t\u00fdmu.\n\nProstor, kde to von\u00ed nejen p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed kosmetikou, ale i firemn\u00ed kulturou, kter\u00e1 d\u00e1v\u00e1 smysl.\ud83d\udc47\n\nhttps:\/\/www.u1.cz\/cs\/produkty\/lobey","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/540450864_1401231275067543_7674272030809430722_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=qphB7e687UUQ7kNvwGhtAIl&_nc_oc=AdohyIsM2Nda8qbGKoS01tXbtY8jIBRrpR0Jj8IbtCBK9-SIQLvY42YN5rqm_mgUjmk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLGilhP-ZFdEPfUBKbZIo9s3eiyTgLmMjSsQUPPtj4v-bYdTXFehihPLzMR2g74DqwVIG5JO8txUg&oh=00_AQHmMrEPK_RDaoBNYxYae3zLEUrS6qvKoKwWMoKPg8T3zg&oe=6A8DEFD0","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DN5lcFojbzT\/","timestamp":"2025-08-28T13:06:41+0000"},{"id":"18013425509601529","caption":"N\u011bkdy je nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed rozd\u00edl pod nohama.\ud83d\udc47\n\nPodlaha nen\u00ed jen o tom, jak vypad\u00e1. Je to n\u00e1stroj, kter\u00fd ovliv\u0148uje akustiku, trvanlivost i celkovou funk\u010dnost prostoru.\n\nProto pracujeme s r\u016fzn\u00fdmi typy podlahov\u00fdch krytin \u2013 od koberc\u016f p\u0159es vinyly a\u017e po zdvojen\u00e9 podlahy. U ka\u017ed\u00e9ho materi\u00e1lu p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161l\u00edme nad jeho technick\u00fdmi vlastnostmi, odolnost\u00ed, \u00fadr\u017ebou i t\u00edm, jak bude fungovat v konkr\u00e9tn\u00edm provozu. \u23f0\n\nProto\u017ee v\u00edme, \u017ee detail rozhoduje o tom, jestli bude prostor nejen kr\u00e1sn\u00fd, ale i p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00fd na ka\u017edodenn\u00ed u\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/538273086_1398571435333527_3926476348847916603_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ru5C8LsRoCUQ7kNvwENH0Te&_nc_oc=Adq37JAcQ-kLdkI6dTg0dT92G-Dgrf-I6WwhY8M3bBNz7R_F9vLDnu3MTve-d-YZYZo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKKGR67x8Gh85OXW9qs7Je_b1071G9mAAuVUAYvBUa3yDvf00Room4UPzBSpB3mxJlboOhr155bnQ&oh=00_AQHBqJliHSebQutM1K91wktx66exi78nnT_-PC497oGMgw&oe=6A8DEAAF","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DNxxVQqWrpQ\/","timestamp":"2025-08-25T12:16:41+0000"},{"id":"18102649141600960","caption":"\ud83d\udcfa Pokud sledujete \u017eiv\u00e9 p\u0159enosy, je velk\u00e1 \u0161ance, \u017ee vid\u00edte i produkty zna\u010dky Chyron.\n\nZa softwarem pro tvorbu p\u0159enosov\u00e9 grafiky, p\u0159ehr\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed a vizualizaci dat v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase pro \u017eivou televizi, zpravodajstv\u00ed, po\u010das\u00ed \u010di sportovn\u00ed produkci stoj\u00ed spousta pr\u00e1ce.\n\nPro ChyronHego jsme proto u\u017e v roce 2015 navrhli a realizovali \u0161pi\u010dkovou kancel\u00e1\u0159, kter\u00e1 jejich n\u00e1ro\u010dnou a kreativn\u00ed pr\u00e1ci podporuje. \n\nA v roce 2021 jsme ji roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159ili o funk\u010dn\u00ed i vizu\u00e1ln\u00ed prvky. T\u0159eba zele\u0148, nov\u00e9 zaseda\u010dky i phone boxy, ale taky centr\u00e1ln\u00ed spole\u010denskou z\u00f3nu.\ud83d\udc47\n\nPod\u00edvejte se na v\u0161echny fotky na webu. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/535433236_1392489299275074_4201757817602142928_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=dTgBROnzlikQ7kNvwHqr8Zh&_nc_oc=AdrFvtwvreEs6Sqi_ALz-DgSLagFoK0fjbFWm_bh6rZN8R5Dfb63zzFTMSQ8-4-ts8o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQILkQ-cELKMQOEfReO_NtU2iQT9_hJIbdoPUJ2jR5TGFv5X6f4K12PdO3x-lQlmbNcJ1q79h7F93w&oh=00_AQFe3EOppe6N9SDt9BFDQwRDLbJw5vMWGof2Gcptea27yw&oe=6A8DD442","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DNfhWSdtKA7\/","timestamp":"2025-08-18T10:10:41+0000"},{"id":"17855255541435254","caption":"Jak \u010dasto chod\u00edte v Nov\u00e1 Zbrojovka do RE.SET Caff\u00e9? \ud83d\udc47\n\nKant\u00fdnu s kav\u00e1rnou jsme u\u017e v roce 2021 dokon\u010dovali \u2013 \u010das hrozn\u011b let\u00ed. Od jej\u00edho dokon\u010den\u00ed na ni r\u00e1di vzpom\u00edn\u00e1me d\u00edky spoust\u011b promy\u0161len\u00fdch detail\u016f \u2013 nap\u0159\u00edklad h\u0159e se zrcadly, kter\u00e1 zapojuje n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edky do p\u0159em\u00fd\u0161len\u00ed o tom, jak prostor funguje \u2013 a dobr\u00e9 atmosf\u00e9\u0159e, kter\u00e1 na m\u00edst\u011b vznikla. \ud83e\udd42","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/525390840_1374933037697367_4447650863758161707_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=WBrCsQBsdyUQ7kNvwH5HDua&_nc_oc=Adpn-DN8Bs5ciURskkM5sAomaERZ2wGxBQbjwctulfaoIhoD9Tjo603h-_1KRDinDt0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJSx_ciLUwDv6Y03IwjDw1yI5bm7rxQcHBuDSvndjvWJ6i5iUaEtRmFVsSd6Fis9fOtysxWWon2LA&oh=00_AQEEOfM16aOf2Qz6o0Jfh8MDGTBuAirIcYXx2GOKad0VmQ&oe=6A8DF892","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DMsLy0AoOQ3\/","timestamp":"2025-07-29T11:41:05+0000"},{"id":"18369904912177222","caption":"\u00da\u010detnictv\u00ed budoucnosti nevznik\u00e1 v nudn\u00e9 kancel\u00e1\u0159i.\ud83d\udc47\ud83e\ude77\n\nProto jsme t\u00fdm Evala p\u0159est\u011bhovali do prostoru, kter\u00fd p\u0159ipom\u00edn\u00e1 sp\u00ed\u0161 zahradu ne\u017e open space. Zav\u011b\u0161en\u00e1 zele\u0148, r\u016f\u017eov\u00e9 akcenty a centr\u00e1ln\u00ed setk\u00e1vac\u00ed z\u00f3na \u2013 to v\u0161e tvo\u0159\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kde se rod\u00ed n\u00e1pady, kter\u00e9 m\u011bn\u00ed obor \u00fa\u010detnictv\u00ed. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/521652572_1371306138060057_5197952155337212157_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Tlf_VwsPEmAQ7kNvwHmCez_&_nc_oc=AdrKeMa3YEkqzolvbYA75B5955dvS7hBDqxHTT5oIJF4hxUbx6JZA5DzkZtPml514c0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKlcQVMFW4Kwe8VUmSlvTeiq_fAZH3woD81R6X-LcgeyDJ34SBnfKwNcUiX-AO1OT_IQ-rR8jeL4g&oh=00_AQEC1xx_uSUM7JLvi2HqJVfmepsMUdkEnFKoIuu9S51q8A&oe=6A8DD4FA","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DMhhwqAIGMc\/","timestamp":"2025-07-25T08:21:22+0000"},{"id":"18172839463339673","caption":"Vra\u0165me se o rok zp\u00e1tky \u2013 pro Infosys jsme tou dobou dokon\u010dovali realizaci spole\u010dn\u00fdch prostor, kter\u00e9 se rozhodn\u011b daj\u00ed pova\u017eovat za netradi\u010dn\u00ed. \ud83d\udc4f\n\nJejich sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed byl toti\u017e d\u011btsk\u00fd koutek, game room s kule\u010dn\u00edkem, fotb\u00e1lkem. Nechyb\u011bl ani PlayStation a propojen\u00ed designu s konceptem ostatn\u00edch prostor tak, aby na sebe \u010d\u00e1sti kancel\u00e1\u0159e dokonale navazovaly.","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/520466700_1367993185058019_7912569416606963287_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=BqCRWFqW5NMQ7kNvwEkM_0-&_nc_oc=AdqtJsDCzn1eXHET4kKGal_ZY8yTZTlOMvoOK5i9YaDpc5Onu2L48keceHJZpdKS48A&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQI902NpOyz2guCkpGf2hTm5Y731M6Ji1a26ZEdiC9VERZ_PXf0rPesEnDsImTBNPCkV6qCAbGgBuw&oh=00_AQGKTPO5cdfR2Rrs7gzbqdOKWCdlHXvOCxd6Y6EQTGMVGA&oe=6A8DEC5B","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DMZ0KX0ibNL\/","timestamp":"2025-07-22T08:28:14+0000"},{"id":"18120848608473160","caption":"Jedna noc. Jeden prostor. Tis\u00edc p\u0159\u00edb\u011bh\u016f.\n\nURBEX v Mal\u00e9 Americe nebyl jen o hudb\u011b a sv\u011btlech. Byl o n\u00e1vratu \u017eivota tam, kde u\u017e z\u016fst\u00e1val jen prach. O poct\u011b prostoru, kter\u00fd si zaslou\u017e\u00ed v\u00edc ne\u017e zapomn\u011bn\u00ed. A o lidech, kte\u0159\u00ed se neboj\u00ed tvo\u0159it i tam, kde jin\u00ed vid\u00ed jen konec.\n\nD\u00edky v\u0161em, kdo byli u toho. \ud83e\udd42","media_type":"VIDEO","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/o1\/v\/t2\/f2\/m86\/AQNZm4B5nbia6PjrP_wK_s02Q9R5QcmSTg1NGo_g-WpJCzHp8BZ2S7UnDs0ueBYMMHtr-KboHcZLpDnUWW0EUdjZ01JCujXh9QnLzi4.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=Oe6KVGHa1DIQ7kNvwHn_sOK&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNjQwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfM192MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTQ0MTYxMTI1MDM1NzI1MSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjQxNCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAwOTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjE3LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=4413f994639ee83&_nc__gdl5p0BAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJdKIErtywJRmwBusdO_1qGE0qOraNSO35nBs7WoW_nNpfQpXj5_E9EV-bQgFApuIYbn8kvuZbQFg&oh=00_AQHud8jdML3rYcK4bigpGqGiWrCHPWpkqTG-oyyVZKpThw&oe=6A89E9BD","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DLmirDzsYrt\/","timestamp":"2025-07-02T10:34:27+0000","thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/569304538_18372905383144339_4403283367241653889_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=DUdAYR3srQoQ7kNvwECRGII&_nc_oc=AdqtXkNQMwvDU7LOeSBh8GVpVdS4obaE1ustTLJJges6RHN3kxOJXHjNByz5fOSLXqU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJ1VQ7nVlHR98sCFwGYCuZbXCBd5_9dxD0Ts_fDS8Tg6jfipXm7s-oBDx50ebzriaZ-JVqWlhOvEA&oh=00_AQGPnzyj7nBax1cnHRjL6s83YbJaPPfYYdWQwjRSCx5rXw&oe=6A8DF246"},{"id":"17956413014806918","caption":"Po dni str\u00e1ven\u00e9m ve v\u00edru m\u011bsta se vrac\u00edte na hotel. Usednete do ko\u017een\u00e9 seda\u010dky, v ruce dr\u017e\u00edte dokonale nam\u00edchan\u00fd drink a o\u010dima klouz\u00e1te po stylov\u00e9m interi\u00e9ru. C\u00edt\u00edte, \u017ee jste na spr\u00e1vn\u00e9m m\u00edst\u011b. \ud83e\udd42\n\nTakov\u00fd m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt hotelov\u00fd z\u00e1\u017eitek \u2014 kdy\u017e je prostor navr\u017een s citem pro detail.","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/501049466_1322074136316591_2473820875875824408_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=fq4Zi_41HOcQ7kNvwGGOLWg&_nc_oc=Adq3yXOm2M5RySYnTgFfPajXfmnT4VX_lul26npG9aUkeutwS7zQVwIKUccLZo1PyCc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLr6ht3cIo6jhw4c6FnPM0ZLFLVkYsrUxPwlQ6YyXXA2QieNBdpF_gh06g9ZBz-9E8jQXS8NAEB0A&oh=00_AQFPIyLFh73lj4W6UdI81dA0fkH0KwxarU4ECEUObkU7Pg&oe=6A8DF87D","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DKMK0phIn2E\/","timestamp":"2025-05-28T08:14:06+0000"},{"id":"18513406720018231","caption":"Recepce, kter\u00e1 nep\u016fsob\u00ed jako recepce \u2013 sp\u00ed\u0161 jako m\u00edsto, kde se chcete na chv\u00edli zastavit. Pro @seyfor_as  jsme v budov\u011b Trimaran o\u017eivili a propojili dva kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9 prostory.\ud83d\udc47\n\nhttps:\/\/www.u1.cz\/cs\/produkty\/seyfor-trimaran","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/501056548_1320429583147713_5428367584806838127_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=BbpeQSWavvwQ7kNvwFksvQ2&_nc_oc=AdoKn9xbhGSaO9vp7lIAsBRLn3OUmNzbIl9fJPjgQ8xEOMXNfRa8dsr3R_LeIhcffj0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKOhrWmL0znc7kggu7qxubgQEiTd6qyfde1jHrqjrsAO0doagnC5h5qu0mqn3hfCT9tyVcwx4G7uA&oh=00_AQGEL3aINcHrP1rEtvmmenUSffRm9H1Rf2kM5uCM4kpPvQ&oe=6A8DF1F3","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DKHCcKXoRe2\/","timestamp":"2025-05-26T08:24:39+0000"},{"id":"17842338528495983","caption":"Ortho Dent ve Vln\u011bn\u011b n\u00e1s nep\u0159est\u00e1v\u00e1 bavit. \ud83d\udc4f\n\nSpojen\u00ed zdravotnick\u00e9ho vybaven\u00ed, historie are\u00e1lu Vln\u011bna, Mal\u00e9ho prince, surov\u00e9ho betonu a pohodl\u00ed v\u0161ech, kte\u0159\u00ed se v prostoru ocitnou.\n\nO realizaci si zanedlouho budete moct p\u0159e\u010d\u00edst v ti\u0161t\u011bn\u00e9m \u010dasopisu @era21_magazine a na\u0161i slu\u017ebu U1 Medical Projects bude reprezentovat v @hospodarky. Je na co se t\u011b\u0161it!","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/497085910_1311723074018364_1089467691899170951_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=nGYPfaeYoogQ7kNvwHErRlQ&_nc_oc=AdqD8Z_tFxQTdTggLnrXzcs2-agn4AKsBAxZkHC_zBEsjdnrO7w6oIckrQGLfrkHJ2g&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJLeyOnOtIe-zCANCzK_zR_EYaGDtn9IJApJdJFmWo4E09vMWeZ3j_3VZlRRroDsLvgbBFPpyqnKA&oh=00_AQHAQOWG5igqtpv4kV-541QVJL9Hhsi4spYlZGmD84FPhQ&oe=6A8DE823","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DJtE7_PI7aS\/","timestamp":"2025-05-16T06:26:13+0000"},{"id":"18046020602139860","caption":"V kancel\u00e1\u0159\u00edch Evala najdete krom\u011b prosv\u00edcen\u00e9ho interi\u00e9ru se spoustou rostlin i mno\u017estv\u00ed m\u00edst pro idea making, brainstormingy, t\u00fdmov\u00e9 porady, pohovory, p\u0159edn\u00e1\u0161ky nebo t\u0159eba jen kafe s kolegy.\n\nZkr\u00e1tka posezen\u00ed v rajsk\u00e9 zahrad\u011b tak, jak m\u00e1 vypadat. \ud83d\udc4f","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/494003388_1298694708654534_9094883463773882051_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=OtGaI9HEsUQQ7kNvwF-OsTT&_nc_oc=AdoRmg8aqdvsfBD8jEAwX187CHHELU4Q9cUQ7TSSb39pemeipD4lmKmha_X-FEsF9Do&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKr6HvFDk8apAF1BtF4f2jsstq0yDrDHvB3IE8A3htbIUurE2D_kj6n9faj-hAPLAaoyw8dv71hDA&oh=00_AQF1A-BHCkRHFWO-W5yed_rxKINO3ZynTl0EBSnKvN_ozA&oe=6A8DD674","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DJBpNuBokGI\/","timestamp":"2025-04-29T09:36:38+0000"},{"id":"17905493145014353","caption":"\ud83c\udf31 Zele\u0148, a\u0165 u\u017e \u017eiv\u00e1 \u010di um\u011bl\u00e1, hraje v ka\u017ed\u00e9m interi\u00e9ru neodmyslitelnou roli.\n\nPod\u00edvejte se, jak\u00e9 m\u00e1 r\u016fzn\u00e9 aplikace, jak ji lze um\u00edstit a \u010demu prosp\u00edv\u00e1. \ud83d\udc47\n\nhttps:\/\/www.u1.cz\/cs\/zelene-oazy-v-kancelarich-jak-dokazou-rostliny-zlepsit-pracovni-prostredi","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/493104929_1297135825477089_8105265691830739665_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=PHaYKOwO1TcQ7kNvwFMbXDb&_nc_oc=AdoNoGWH0rQKaeJA6456ZMiE_d_UslEtVvwaowvu-KsNcH0Aa_EFVLHw9gvVDsrfTrI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLO4_5UmKUh9N3JiAgwuzJ7sYvCHz_VFJRyTzZQB3DkqRetwxO_hGhz8Rq5iqGVMXNmx8B90P0usQ&oh=00_AQEBBrnFSMpvhp1Nr2oc0hFWIJA42rITeEnyM-59GXvkBw&oe=6A8DD84D","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DGcnMT1M1cg\/","timestamp":"2025-02-24T07:24:16+0000"},{"id":"18088929301514153","caption":"Podlahy u\u017e d\u00e1vno nemus\u00ed b\u00fdt nejm\u00e9n\u011b zaj\u00edmavou \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9ho interi\u00e9ru. Podivejte se t\u0159eba na ostravsk\u00e9 Clubco, Conectart nebo Bombus.\n\nDo v\u0161ech t\u011bchto prostor\u016f byly um\u00edst\u011bny podlahy, kter\u00e9 pln\u00ed jak praktick\u00fd, tak estetick\u00fd \u00fa\u010del. \ud83e\udd1d","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/492522570_1294334832423855_778678362578594172_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=nfYcLz5S-WsQ7kNvwEIqjKN&_nc_oc=AdrcGPAIEHFV4F3BgC0hUp0WPvn_ShBhKHC_ldFqOt0SM2Rny1b9Sas5_7f0IZZdAf0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=8G-8Y1KcLepIkJJUVq_mnw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKVnJkxAMJpPyrj60GuhsuNvK2fwFsKs9eh0-O0N5ibWrnpavJw68-exqMNvCf-N-gcxeI4ANZZ4w&oh=00_AQG7rf-no_S1aDSXoREyzhpbnTDmf8xCTy20HmnUjXts-w&oe=6A8DF691","permalink":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DCi4yjxISQz\/","timestamp":"2024-11-19T07:47:54+0000"},{"id":"18108770710426516","caption":"D\u0159evo m\u00e1 svoje kouzlo. V\u0161ichni ho m\u00e1me doma, je ale vhodn\u00e9 ho pou\u017e\u00edt i v kancel\u00e1\u0159sk\u00fdch interi\u00e9rech? \ud83e\udd14\n\nP\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00edme realizace, kter\u00e9 v\u00e1m na tuto ot\u00e1zku odpov\u00ed. \ud83d\udc46","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https:\/\/scontent-prg1-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t39.30808-6\/493288527_1293541855836486_5295726663198098409_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=r4ee45JPCv4Q7kNvwEyvq5Y&_nc_oc=AdoXrWvxLBi9cmxQXN_bVx5VqEjAK14bo-jf5cPWvPHtzh4